# A typed-CRDT apply resolves its route without the replication-apply mark, so
# it lands on a copy a coordinated restore holds closed (#5294).
MODULE: NothingLandsOnFencedCopyFoldUnfenced
TARGET: NothingLandsOnFencedCopy
CLASS: Action
SUMMARY: the CRDT apply skips the restored copy's receive fence
PERTURBS: Deliver

--- FIND
    /\ IF ~up["Copy"]
--- REPLACE
    /\ IF ~up["Copy"] /\ kind[e] # "Crdt"
--- END
